    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 18 Radcliff Hall, St Johns Road, Sandymount, Dublin 4 to the market. Positioned in the heart of Dublin 4, this exceptionally spacious two-bedroom apartment offers a rare blend of refined coastal living and village convenience. This fully renovated top floor dual aspect apartment is packed with superb features such as its modern kitchen and large living room/dining room. Situated within easy reach of a wide range of excellent amenities, schools, transport links, parks and coastal walks, this stunning property is sure to generate strong interest from a wide audience.\n\nNo.18 is an immaculate two-bedroom apartment located on the top floor of this prestigious development. Accessed via a lift, this home offers excellent security and bright, fresh interiors. An entrance hall with a separate storeroom leads through to the large living/dining room with a bay window overlooking the beautiful historic St John the Evangelist church. The bespoke kitchen features a range of modern floor/wall units as well as integrated appliances. To the rear of the property there are two double bedrooms (main with en-suite) with built-in wardrobes, and both have access to the balcony. There is a further guest shower room.\n\nRadcliff Hall is a luxury gated development situated just off St. John's Road and Park Avenue. It is conveniently located adjacent to the delightful board walks on Sandymount strand, Greenway cycling and is a 15-minute walk to Sandymount Village which has a selection of specialty shops, restaurants and pubs. The area is home to many of Dublin's leading schools and colleges. Sport clubs and a wide range of recreational facilities are located close by including WestWood gym/spa, Aviva stadium, Belvedere, Wanderers, and Lansdowne Rugby Clubs to name a few. There is excellent public transport available with a wide selection of Buses and the Sydney Parade Dart station is also within 5 minutes walking distance, providing ease of access to Dublin city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith wooden flooring, recessed lighting, phone intercom, ceiling coving, alarm panel, large storeroom with built in shelving, shelved hot-press, double doors to living room/dining room and access to kitchen.\n\nLiving Room/Dining Room: - \nWith wooden flooring, recessed lighting, ceiling coving, glass hatch to kitchen, feature gas fire, tv/phone points and a bay window to the front.\n\nKitchen: - \nA modern kitchen with a range of floor and wall units, tiled flooring and tiled back splash, spot lighting, integrated fridge/freezer, integrated oven/hobs, integrated dish washer, integrated washer/dryer and stainless-steel sink with drainer.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nDouble room with wooden flooring, built in wardrobes, tv/phone points, a large window overlooking the communal garden, a door to the en-suite and a door to the balcony.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nWith tiled flooring and tiled walls, w.c. wash hand basin, large walk-in shower with rainfall attachment, chrome wall mounted heated towel rail and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble room with wooden flooring, built in wardrobes and a door to the balcony.\n\nShower Room: - \nWith tiled flooring and tiled walls, w.c. wash hand basin, chrome wall mounted heated towel rail and a shower with rainfall attachment.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Turnkey, fully renovated two-bedroom top floor apartment</li><li> Stunning features throughout</li><li> Lift access</li><li> Gated secure parking</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Excellent location near to Sandymount Strand</li><li> Close to DART</li><li> Double glazing throughout</li><li> Communal EV charging points for residents</li><li> Communal maintained grounds and mature gardens</li><li> Service Charge TBC</ul>"
      },
      {
